{"seq":1,"slug":"fst-term-dictionary-term-index","title":"FST 词典与 term index：前缀共享与字典查找","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/lucene-elasticsearch-engine-segments-inverted-index/term-dictionary-encoding/fst-term-dictionary-term-index","wordCount":2585,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"fst-词典与-term-index-前缀共享与字典查找\">FST 词典与 term index：前缀共享与字典查找</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Lucene 的段（segment）一旦 flush 就不可变，段内的 term dictionary（词典）随之冻结。查询时给定一个 term 字符串，必须在词典里定位到它的 posting list 偏移量。最直接的方案是把所有 term 排序成一个数组做二分查找——实现简单，但排序数组要保存每条 term 的完整字节，一个千万级 SKU 的 <code>keyword</code> 字段词典轻松膨胀到数 GB，无法常驻堆内存。</p>\n<p>Lucene 用<strong>两级结构</strong>把「常驻内存的部分」和「留在磁盘的部分」拆开：内存里只放一张前缀共享图（FST），磁盘上放真正的 term 数据。这带来一个反直觉的性质——<strong>内存查找成本只与 term 长度有关，与词典总量无关</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>term index</td>\n<td>FST（finite state transducer，有限状态转换器）</td>\n<td>常驻 JVM 堆</td>\n<td>存前缀共享图，把前缀映射到磁盘 block 偏移量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>term dictionary</td>\n<td>BlockTree（<code>.tim</code>）</td>\n<td>磁盘</td>\n<td>按前缀分块，块内以「共享前缀长度 + 后缀字节」紧凑存 term</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>postings</td>\n<td><code>.doc</code> / <code>.pos</code></td>\n<td>磁盘</td>\n<td>doc id、词频、位置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Q[&quot;查询 term: iphone 15 pro&quot;] --&gt; TI[&quot;term index FST&lt;br/&gt;(常驻堆, 前缀共享图)&quot;]&#10;    TI --&gt;|&quot;前缀 iphone 15 &quot;| BP[&quot;block 文件指针 fp&quot;]&#10;    BP --&gt; TDB[&quot;.tim 块&lt;br/&gt;共享前缀 + 后缀字节&quot;]&#10;    TDB --&gt; PL[&quot;postings 指针&quot;]&#10;    PL --&gt; BM[&quot;求交 + 打分&quot;]\">graph TD\n    Q[\"查询 term: iphone 15 pro\"] --&gt; TI[\"term index FST&lt;br/&gt;(常驻堆, 前缀共享图)\"]\n    TI --&gt;|\"前缀 iphone 15 \"| BP[\"block 文件指针 fp\"]\n    BP --&gt; TDB[\".tim 块&lt;br/&gt;共享前缀 + 后缀字节\"]\n    TDB --&gt; PL[\"postings 指针\"]\n    PL --&gt; BM[\"求交 + 打分\"]</pre><p>这张图里最关键的一条边是「前缀 → block 指针」：FST 并不存 <code>iphone 15 pro</code> 的完整字节，它只保证从根走到该前缀的路径存在，并把路径终点的输出值（block 在 <code>.tim</code> 中的偏移）带回。真正的 term 字节留在磁盘块里，读到才展开。FST 的结构与构造算法见 Apache Lucene 的 <code>FST</code> 类文档（<a href=\"https://lucene.apache.org/core/9_11_1/core/org/apache/lucene/util/fst/FST.html\">lucene.apache.org/core/9_11_1/core/org/apache/lucene/util/fst/FST.html</a>）；把 FST 引入倒排索引词典的工程动因，最早由 Lucene 作者 Mike McCandless 在 2010 年的文章里系统阐述（<em>Using Finite State Transducers in Lucene</em>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前缀共享与最小化-fst-的构造\">前缀共享与最小化 FST 的构造</h2><p>FST 是一个<strong>确定性、无环、最小化</strong>的自动机：每条弧带一个字节标签（byte label）和一个可选的输出值（output）。它与 trie 的根本差别是<strong>同时共享后缀</strong>。</p>\n<p>看一个例子：某商品字段的 term 与词频为 <code>{&quot;cat&quot;:5, &quot;rat&quot;:5, &quot;car&quot;:3}</code>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>trie 会为 <code>cat</code> 与 <code>car</code> 共享前缀 <code>ca</code>，但 <code>cat</code> 与 <code>rat</code> 的 <code>at</code> 各存一份，共 8 个节点。</li>\n<li>FST 在构造末尾做最小化：<strong>输出相同的等价子树合并成同一个状态</strong>。<code>cat</code> 与 <code>rat</code> 走到 <code>a</code> 之后，剩余子树都是「读 <code>t</code> 然后输出 5」，结构完全相同，于是被合并为同一状态。结果状态数降到 5 个左右。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>构造分两步完成（见 <code>FST</code> 类文档的 <code>Builder</code> 一节）：先按键的<strong>字节序</strong>依次插入，构建未最小化的临时状态（缓冲在 <code>uncheckedNodes</code> 中）；每当一个节点确定不会被后续 key 复用，就把它哈希后尝试与已有状态合并（hash-consing）。重复的状态被复用，最终得到最小 DFA。</p>\n<p>这个「排序输入 + 增量最小化」的约束解释了为什么 FST 只能从<strong>有序</strong> key 构建——倒排索引天然按 term 排序写盘，正好满足。FST 常驻内存的体量近似为状态数乘以每条弧的平均序列化字节数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>FST</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>FST</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mtext> 字节</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{FST}} \\approx |S_{\\text{FST}}| \\cdot \\bar{b}, \\qquad \\bar{b} \\in [2, 6] \\text{ 字节}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">FST</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">FST</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0257em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取决于弧的编码方式。编译后的 FST 把弧压进 <code>byte[]</code>，用标志位而不是独立字段表达结构：<code>BIT_FINAL_ARC</code>（是终止弧）、<code>BIT_LAST_ARC</code>（该状态最后一条弧）、<code>BIT_TARGET_NEXT</code>（目标状态紧邻，省掉显式指针）、<code>BIT_STOP_NODE</code>（无出弧）、<code>BIT_ARC_HAS_OUTPUT</code>、<code>BIT_ARC_HAS_FINAL_OUTPUT</code>。弧标签本身用 1–4 字节变长编码（内部称 <code>isBye1/2/3/4</code>），ASCII 小写字母只需 1 字节。这套编码是 FST 能「即使上亿 term 也压到几十 MB 量级堆」的直接原因——具体数值随词典分布变化，官方文档只给出设计目标，不承诺固定倍率。</p>\n<p>另一个维度是<strong>输出值的编码</strong>。term index 里输出是 <code>FSTTermOutputs</code>（block 指针加标志位）；而在 doc values 或 sorted-set 的序号映射里，输出是 <code>PositiveIntOutputs</code>，表示 term 的 ordinal。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个 term 的序号理论上需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>ordinal</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_{\\text{ordinal}} = \\lceil \\log_2 N \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ordinal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span> bit，但因为用变长编码，序号小于 128 的 term 只占 1 字节。电商目录里 95% 的长尾 SKU 都落在小序号段，实际均值远低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil \\log_2 N \\rceil / 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mord\">/8</span></span></span></span></span> 字节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"blocktree-与-term-index-的两级寻址\">BlockTree 与 term index 的两级寻址</h2><p>BlockTree 结构自 Lucene 4.0 起引入（对应 JIRA 议题 LUCENE-3312），取代了早期把整份词典一次性加载的实现。它把每个字段的 term <strong>按前缀切成 block</strong>：写盘时以目标块大小为约束聚集 term，<code>BlockTreeTermsWriter</code> 的默认参数是每块最少 25 个、最多 48 个条目。</p>\n<p>每个 block 的「前缀 key」（块内第一条 term 的前缀）被写进 <code>.tip</code> 文件里的 FST。FST 的输出是 <code>FSTTermOutputs</code>，编码三样东西：该 block 在 <code>.tim</code> 中的文件指针 <code>fp</code>、该块是否含 term、该块是否为 floor 块。注意文件分离的意义——<code>.tip</code> 存 FST 索引，<code>.tim</code> 存数据块，正因为 FST 要常驻/按需 mmap 而数据块只在 seek 时读。</p>\n<p>块内每条 term 的存储格式是本章「词典编码与压缩」的核心：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"[共享前缀长度 prefixLength (vint)]&#10;[剩余后缀字节 suffix bytes]&#10;[docFreq / totalTermFreq 元数据]&#10;[skip data（跳表指针）]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[共享前缀长度 prefixLength (vint)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[剩余后缀字节 suffix bytes]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[docFreq / totalTermFreq 元数据]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[skip data（跳表指针）]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>也就是说，块内相邻 term 的公共前缀只存一次，其余用后缀拼接。当某个前缀下 term 暴涨（典型如电商里的高频品牌词 <code>usb</code>、颜色 <code>black</code>），writer 会把大块拆成若干 <strong>floor 块</strong>并记录 <code>floorData</code>，使得 seek 能在块内做二分而不是线性扫描。</p>\n<h2 id=\"字典查找的执行路径\">字典查找的执行路径</h2><p>一次精确查找的完整链路是 <code>BlockTreeTermsReader</code> → 字段的 <code>FieldReader</code>（持有 FST 索引读取器）→ <code>BlockTreeTermsEnum.seekExact(term)</code>。内存侧由 <code>FSTEnum</code> 完成：它维护一个<strong>弧栈</strong>（<code>Arc</code> 数组），记录每层已走过的位置，这样 <code>next()</code> 能回到上一层继续推进，<code>seekExact</code> 则一路走到底并确认终点是 <code>BIT_FINAL_ARC</code>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;TermsEnum.seekExact(term)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;FST 逐字节下推&lt;br/&gt;匹配最长前缀&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C{&quot;命中 block?&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[&quot;seek 到 .tim 的 fp&lt;br/&gt;块内扫描或二分&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[&quot;回退 floor block&lt;br/&gt;按 floorData 二分&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F{&quot;块内找到 term?&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[&quot;读 docFreq / totalTermFreq&lt;br/&gt;返回 postings 指针&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[&quot;NOT_FOUND&lt;br/&gt;或 seekCeil 的下一个 term&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"TermsEnum.seekExact(term)\"] --&gt; B[\"FST 逐字节下推&lt;br/&gt;匹配最长前缀\"]\n    B --&gt; C{\"命中 block?\"}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[\"seek 到 .tim 的 fp&lt;br/&gt;块内扫描或二分\"]\n    C --&gt;|否| E[\"回退 floor block&lt;br/&gt;按 floorData 二分\"]\n    D --&gt; F{\"块内找到 term?\"}\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt;|是| G[\"读 docFreq / totalTermFreq&lt;br/&gt;返回 postings 指针\"]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[\"NOT_FOUND&lt;br/&gt;或 seekCeil 的下一个 term\"]</pre><p>整条路径的代价可以拆成三段：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>lookup</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>FST 下推</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>块内定位</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>读 postings 指针</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{lookup}} = \\underbrace{O(\\lvert t \\rvert)}_{\\text{FST 下推}} + \\underbrace{O(\\log B)}_{\\text{块内定位}} + \\underbrace{O(1)}_{\\text{读 postings 指针}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lookup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3263em;vertical-align:-1.5763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">FST </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">下推</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.68