ss=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3263em;vertical-align:-1.5763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">块内定位</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4624em;vertical-align:-1.7124em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">读</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"> postings </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">指针</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7124em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lvert t \\rvert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 是 term 的字节长度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 是块内 term 数（受 48 上限约束，近似常数）。<strong>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>（词典总量）没有出现在公式里</strong>——这正是 FST 相对 B-tree 的关键优势：B-tree 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_B N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 次可能触发磁盘随机读的下降，FST 把这段完全放进内存顺序扫描。</p>\n<p>对范围与前缀查询，<code>seekCeil</code> 复用同一个 FST：找不到精确匹配时，<code>FSTEnum</code> 返回按字典序大于等于目标的最小 term，于是 range query 被降解为「一次 seek + 反复 next」，next 的平均代价同样是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的弧栈操作。这也是 <code>prefix</code> query 与 <code>wildcard</code>（非前导通配符除外）能在 Lucene 上高效实现的原因——它们本质是在 FST 上做有界遍历。段合并会重建 FST，因此合并期间的词典序列化开销与这一章描述的结构直接相关，见本 hub 的<a href=\"../segment-merge-operations/\">段合并</a>章节；不可变段内词典的写入时机，则见<a href=\"../lucene-segment-write-model/\">段写入模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境电商词典的膨胀与堆内存取舍\">跨境电商词典的膨胀与堆内存取舍</h2><p>对跨境电商的多语言商品库，FST 的体量会被三个因素推高，需要在建模阶段就做取舍。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，分词器决定 term 数量。</strong> 日语需要 Kuromoji、韩语需要 Nori、泰语需要词典分词，阿拉伯语需要归一化（<code>arabic_normalization</code>）把不同书写变体折叠到同一 term。同一商品字段经多语言分词后的唯一 term 数，往往比英文高一个量级。正因如此，多语言字段应显式指定 analyzer，而不是依赖默认的 <code>standard</code> 分词器把整串中日韩文本切碎。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，高基数精确值不该走 text 字段。</strong> SKU、ASIN、EAN 这类只做精确匹配的字段，应为 <code>keyword</code> 类型并依赖 doc_values 承载全量唯一值；若误用 <code>text</code>，analyzer 会额外产生大量无意义的 term 塞进 FST，同时精确匹配还会失配。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，堆内存有硬门槛。</strong> FST 常驻堆，Elasticsearch 官方建议单节点堆不超过物理内存的 50%，且<strong>控制在 32GB 以下</strong>——这是 JVM 压缩普通对象指针（compressed oops）的阈值：一旦越过，对象指针宽度从 4 字节翻倍到 8 字节，同样的堆能装下的对象反而变少。可用的堆上限近似为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>RAM</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>30</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>31</mn><mtext> GB</mtext><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{\\max} \\approx \\min\\!\\left(0.5 \\cdot M_{\\text{RAM}},\\ 30\\text{–}31\\ \\text{GB}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">RAM</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">31</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GB</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>（依据 Elasticsearch 官方 <em>Advanced configuration</em> 与 <em>Heap sizing</em> 文档，<a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/advanced-configuration.html\">elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/advanced-configuration.html</a>）。配套的几项约束：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>默认 / 建议值</th>\n<th>与词典的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>index.mapping.total_fields.limit</code></td>\n<td>1000（ES 7+ 默认）</td>\n<td>防止商品属性动态映射导致字段爆炸，每个字段的 FST 都要占堆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JVM heap</td>\n<td>≤ 物理内存 50% 且 &lt; 32GB</td>\n<td>FST 常驻堆，堆越界触发 GC 抖动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分片数</td>\n<td>按数据量而非节点数</td>\n<td>分片越多，每分片独立的 FST 常驻堆越多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>frozen / cold index</td>\n<td>冷商品目录启用</td>\n<td>冻结分片把 FST 从堆挪到磁盘，用查询延迟换堆空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>segment 数量</td>\n<td>控制合并节奏</td>\n<td>每个段一份 FST，段过多则词典内存放大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>第四，merge 会重建 FST。</strong> 段合并时，被合并段的词典必须解压、归并、重新构建 FST 并序列化——这是 merge 的主要 CPU 与 IO 成本之一，也是大段合并期间搜索延迟毛刺的来源。<code>force_merge</code> 一次把多个小段压成大段，短期能降低 FST 的总内存占用，代价是一次性重写开销，应放在低峰期执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>term dictionary 是<strong>两级结构</strong>：内存里的 FST term index 只存前缀共享图，磁盘上的 BlockTree（<code>.tim</code>）存真正的 term 字节，两者由 <code>.tip</code> 中的 FST 输出（block 指针）连接。</li>\n<li>FST 是确定性、无环、<strong>最小化</strong>的自动机，同时共享前缀与后缀；增量最小化靠 hash-consing 合并等价子树，因此只能从有序 key 构建。</li>\n<li>编译后的 FST 用标志位（<code>BIT_FINAL_ARC</code>、<code>BIT_TARGET_NEXT</code> 等）加 1–4 字节变长弧标签压缩，这是它能把上亿 term 压到几十 MB 级堆的前提。</li>\n<li>BlockTree 默认每块 25–48 个 term，大块拆成 floor 块以支持块内二分；块内 term 以「共享前缀长度 + 后缀字节」存储，即「词典编码与压缩」的核心。</li>\n<li>查找代价是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\lvert t \\rvert) + O(\\log B) + O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">∣)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<strong>与词典总量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 无关</strong>，这是 FST 相对 B-tree 的根本优势。</li>\n<li>跨境电商场景下，多语言分词、<code>keyword</code> 高基数字段的误用、以及 JVM 堆 32GB 压缩指针阈值，是决定 FST 内存表现的三条主线；merge 会重建 FST，是延迟毛刺的来源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"FST 词典与 term index：前缀共享与字典查找","id":"fst-词典与-term-index-前缀共享与字典查找"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"前缀共享与最小化 FST 的构造","id":"前缀共享与最小化-fst-的构造"},{"level":2,"text":"BlockTree 与 term index 的两级寻址","id":"blocktree-与-term-index-的两级寻址"},{"level":2,"text":"字典查找的执行路径","id":"字典查找的执行路径"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境电商词典的膨胀与堆内存取舍","id":"跨境电商词典的膨胀与堆内存取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"不可变段上的更新与删除：墓碑、软删除与版本并发控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/lucene-elasticsearch-engine-segments-inverted-index/lucene-segment-write-model/document-update-delete-tombstone-versioning"},"next":{"title":"倒排表压缩：delta 编码、分块定长与跳表定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/lucene-elasticsearch-engine-segments-inverted-index/term-dictionary-encoding/postings-delta-frame-of-reference-skiplist"}}